        {
          "term": "cirigliano",
          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "The chiral Lagrangian of lowest order, $O(G_F p^2)$, contains two LECs $g_8,g_{27}$ to describe nonleptonic weak decays of kaons \\cite{cronin67}. Especially the value of the octet coupling $g_8$ is very sensitive to chiral corrections \\cite{Kambor:1991ah}. Isospin breaking corrections are potentially important for the 27-plet coupling constant $g_{27}$. The present status is presented in Table \\ref{tab:g827}.",
      "extractCut": true
    },
